---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FeedbackSurvey from '../components/FeedbackSurvey.vue';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<Layout title="Feedback on Playbook for America">
  <main>
    <div class="container pt-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <header class="mb-12">
          <h1 class="mb-8 text-4xl text-p4a-ink font-bold">Share your perspective on P4A</h1>
          <p class="mb-2 leading-relaxed">
            Please take 2 minutes to share your feedback on Playbook for America (P4A).
          </p>
          <p class="mb-2 leading-relaxed">
            <!-- The Playbook for America (P4A) exists to bring together ideas and programs that improve government, strengthen democracy, and renew civic life in the United States. -->
            Playbook for America is a platform where people can surface civic problems, crowdsource solutions, and help turn the best ideas into positive civic outcomes.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-2 leading-relaxed">
            <!-- Organized as a nonpartisan nonprofit, P4A operates an online platform where citizens and government officials can crowdsource, discuss, and rank ideas and programs, with a focus on turning the most promising ones into actionable solutions. Our aim is to elevate the best ideas from all corners of the nation and help move them toward real-world impact. -->
            Your input will directly help us improve this.
          </p>
        </header>

      <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-8 text-p4a-ink">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Here is how it works</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <!-- Every contribution fits into a clear path forward. Issues define problems, Ideas propose solutions, and Playbooks turn promising ideas into action and outcomes. -->
          <!-- Playbook for America is built around three connected building blocks. Issues define problems. Ideas propose solutions. Playbooks turn strong ideas into coordinated action and measurable outcomes. -->
          P4A turns public problems into proposed solutions and then into action-ready Playbooks.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr] items-stretch gap-2">
          <div class="bg-p4a-surface rounded shadow-md border border-p4a-ink">
            <div class="bg-p4a-navy py-1 text-xl text-white text-center font-bold rounded-t">
              <div class="justify-center flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="ph:hand-palm" /> Issue</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 text-sm sm:text-center">A clearly defined public <span class="font-bold text-p4a-body-text uppercase">problem</span> that deserves attention, understanding, and targeted solutions.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-body-text hidden md:block" name="ph:arrow-right-bold" />
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-body-text md:hidden" name="ph:arrow-down-bold" />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-p4a-surface rounded shadow-md border border-p4a-ink">
            <div class="bg-p4a-navy py-1 text-xl text-white text-center font-bold rounded-t">
              <div class="justify-center flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="ph:lightbulb" /> Idea</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 text-sm sm:text-center">A proposed <span class="font-bold text-p4a-body-text uppercase">solution</span> to an Issue which is ready to be discussed, improved, and strengthened.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-body-text hidden md:block" name="ph:arrow-right-bold" />
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-body-text md:hidden" name="ph:arrow-down-bold" />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-p4a-surface rounded shadow-md border border-p4a-ink">
            <div class="bg-p4a-navy py-1 text-xl text-white text-center font-bold rounded-t">
              <div class="justify-center flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="ph:book-open-text" /> Playbook</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 text-sm sm:text-center">An execution-ready <span class="font-bold text-p4a-body-text uppercase">plan</span> that turns strong Ideas into coordinated action, ownership, and measurable results.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>


        <section class="mb-14">
          <p class="pt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Your feedback is anonymous unless you choose to share your email.
          </p>
          <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <FeedbackSurvey client:load />
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
